abstract: >-
  The Frohmanian Symplectic Tether proof of 3D incompressible Navier–Stokes
  global regularity on the periodic torus, with its Lean 4 formalization.
  The work introduces a symplectic tether on coadjoint orbits and a two-layer
  geometric/analytic architecture.
